id: terrifying-teamwork-dedicated-team
name: Dedicated Team
order: 1
slot: trait
description: >
  You are accustomed to fighting with a specific group of people.
text: >
  Dedicated Team: You are accustomed to fighting with a specific group of people.
  (1)-[Ruling]: Upon gaining access to this Awakening, name and declare a ‘Villainous Team’. All Adversaries who possess this Awakening and have declared the same ‘Villainous Team’ are on your ‘Villainous Team’.
  (2)-[Passive]: While an Ally (that is not Defeated) is in your Villainous Team, increase your Combat Rolls by 1(T).
  (3)-[Passive]: Double the bonuses from the 2nd effect of the Teamwork Talent.
  (4)-[Passive]: Gain access to the ‘Kill Box’ Adversary Maneuver.
  (5)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If an Ally that is in your Villainous Team deals Damage to an Opponent with an Attacking Maneuver, you may use the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. If you do, you must target an Opponent that received Damage from your Ally’s Attacking Maneuver.
  (6)-[Triggered/Start of Combat Round]: If an Opponent is in the Kill Box, you may use the Basic Attack Maneuver or Signature Technique Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. If you do, you do not have to pay the Ki Point Cost for this Attacking Maneuver.
  (7)-[Triggered/Start of Combat Round]: If 1/2 of PCC Opponents or more would be in the Kill Box after using the Kill Box Maneuver, you may use the Kill Box Adversary Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

---

# (1) The Villainous Team: its name the table's; its members are the Allies on the Settings tab (docs/RULINGS.md: Allies are that list).

# (2) An Ally of your Villainous Team not Defeated: Combat Rolls 1(T).
[passive, effect 2]
if (alliesStanding) {
    combatRolls += 1(T);
}

# (3) Teamwork (2)'s bonuses doubled: its 1(T) on your United Attack's Strike and Wound, 2(T) (united-attack.mjs).
[passive, effect 3]
united.teamworkMultiplier *= 2;

# (4) Kill Box, opened.
[passive, effect 4]
allow maneuver.kill-box;

# (5) Once a Round, an Ally of your team Damaging an Opponent with an Attacking Maneuver: a Basic Attack out of sequence at that
# Opponent - offered on that attack's card (chat.mjs offerAllyDamageBasic).
[passive, effect 5]
allow allyDamage.basicAttack;

# (6) An Opponent in the Kill Box: Basic Attack or Signature Technique out of sequence, without its Ki Point Cost (the table's to waive).
[triggered/start-of-round, outOfSequence, effect 6]
offerOneOf(basic-attack, signature-technique);

# (7) Half of PCC Opponents or more would be in it: Kill Box out of sequence. Who would be: the table's.
[triggered/start-of-round, outOfSequence, effect 7]
maneuverOutOfSequence(kill-box);
